{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "6ffdf36d5764ca7d4cb56010f8e064d0389798510a9b4b5b4160bc4645a22602", "ja": "共に─ランタイムライブラリ─", "zh": "同在─运行时库─", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "120bfb074ee4dcd6b4ee661864372c37736138f4014fde24e1da71053d4f2465", "ja": "『EScape』のファンイベントは大成功。\n志保、瑞希、紬は、プロデューサーと感想を\n言い合いながら、ココロの形を確かめ合って\nいくのだった。", "zh": "“EScape”的粉丝活动大获成功。\n志保、瑞希和紬与制作人一边互诉感想，\n一边确认着彼此心灵的模样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0f380b4218ad106c064cf58f469e9b2940aeb43c3f4224f75da0d76ec6153cd9", "ja": "（『EScape』のファンイベントは大盛況のまま\n幕を閉じた。優しい拍手は、温かな雨のようだ）", "zh": "（《EScape》的粉丝活动在一片盛况中落下帷幕。温柔的掌声，宛如温暖的雨）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4bf251bc930b9dd61355a88479bd373276e9da28224ed5d1f1762de4b4739191", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。再び『EScape』として\n出演してみて、どうだった？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。再次以『EScape』的身份登台演出，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "ffcd28f949edd9c8c5f29de8e12ff6ce6ca2bcb51c618ccef1333f83f52ca783", "ja": "もちろん、楽しかったです。こんなイベントを\n開催していただけるとは……アンドロイド冥利、だぞ。", "zh": "当然很开心。没想到还能举办这样的活动……作为仿生人，真是太值得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "1a1967b376549289e9693d131c989fe4b9495a1b0ac08a7641c02f6f78a47aea", "ja": "はい。本編の終わり方が、あんな感じでしたから……\nどんな台本か、気になってましたけど。", "zh": "是的。因为正篇就是以那种方式结束的……所以我一直很在意剧本会是什么样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f55151b25f79961c3275e1f5d1e3619208a256faeda53e0f82e4d03c8d3340a1", "ja": "そうですね。今日のステージも夢か現か、\nはっきりとは描写されないもので……。", "zh": "是啊。因为今天的舞台究竟是梦境还是现实，也没有明确描写出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "eacde9a3c021bc86a041f47b4223aee0d1744818bb8ab64b8671cf348443f7de", "ja": "でも、もしかしたらという想像をファンの\nみなさんにも楽しんでもらえたようで、一安心です。", "zh": "不过，看来粉丝们也享受到了“说不定会这样”的想象，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f5899b91b2a597a2d07620912401c9d5633e4ae96814b42c2669d41950271394", "ja": "ああ。人間とアンドロイドで同じ夢を見るような、\nそんなステージだったと思う。", "zh": "啊。我觉得那是一场让人类和安卓仿佛做着同一个梦的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c2e31a50bfcfcecb13a05a6e9562bc058e03a2360e4b79630f2fff2b7cc26f93", "ja": "改めて、難しいステージをよくやり切ってくれた。\nお悩みへの回答も、真心がこもっていて……。", "zh": "再次感谢你们出色地完成了这么困难的舞台。对烦恼的回答也饱含真心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "ea7f33d425c9b7d4a2e8a5adb508ec70598b119ce3d41db704c59a8a4e65a45b", "ja": "そういえば、今日のステージで読んだお悩み、\n選んだのは{$P$}ですか？", "zh": "说起来，今天在舞台上读到的烦恼，是{$P$}选的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b4fa9b49a9a4cb7ac33fea48c96a47a9ada40302d2d38b116a3251cdbd31f5f0", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。一応内容には\n目を通しておかないといけないし。", "zh": "啊，是的。毕竟还是得大致看一下内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "65a6559f9af9dc8b8ae75f33695bddd583cb04a292af608f6fccb4219618f2c8", "ja": "やっぱり、\n{$P$}さんだったんですね。", "zh": "果然，\n是{$P$}先生啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b9684b1d5e6f601fe07d4964585e37f5b7086228af06dce74c0644d9258fe2b1", "ja": "やっぱり？", "zh": "果然？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "852fe239db02dbf172a23ea2e2bea9b55d27960dfbfec06c3ba76357edd19946", "ja": "なんだか、私たちの反応を面白がるような\n意図を少し感じたので。", "zh": "总觉得对方似乎有意拿我们的反应取乐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f87fb086c817bad89531cdb16a11931c5bccfbab9978d022b4d1d2e7a4f12a0e", "ja": "まさか……わざと、困らせるような？", "zh": "难道……是故意想让我们为难？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c1f92efc119835da409102994c0f76d9c7f2dbaed6b71ba17d1d4080143f189b", "ja": "ち、違う違う！　ただ、この3人なら共感して、\nいい答えを出してくれそうだと思っただけで。", "zh": "不、不是不是！只是觉得，这3个人应该会有共鸣，能给出不错的答案而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "c5c1b878942f5f43a1531c62f30f0920603569244ff562002cff3e8e1a1f08e2", "ja": "なるほど……。笑顔が下手っぴなお悩みに\n関しては、確かに共感してしまいました。", "zh": "原来如此……对于那个不擅长露出笑容的烦恼，我确实也感同身受了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "11154fe25878b9199491b6628df8cdf71c0de64e026279dd8e512c44aa49b3b1", "ja": "私も、陸上部の子の悩みには共感したかも。", "zh": "我好像也对田径部那个孩子的烦恼产生了共鸣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7dc714e0ff5d195711eef42112c158fb6448c9f515a297899c1bce0aa405c0cd", "ja": "それなら、私は……恋の悩みを\nしている、という話になってしまいますが……。", "zh": "那样的话，就变成我也在为恋爱烦恼……了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9a31091de4c3aa33e8be87969b7cc7893700406b5316e7a1451d751b58f40584", "ja": "頭の中が、特定の誰かでいっぱいになっている、と。\nそんな風に思われて……？　う、うぅ。", "zh": "也就是说，脑子里全是某个特定的人。你们是这么认为的吗……？呜、呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3d35de81aaacf139426db9b80990ff05d5bac63f03c25aa82eab18b12ae9aae9", "ja": "い、いやいや、考えすぎだよ！\nほら、恋愛相談って、やっぱり花形だし……。", "zh": "不、不不不，您想太多了！\n你看，恋爱咨询果然是最受欢迎的嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "90935e99c3e740c9c706efeab7856c6dad0f8cd3e0ef4beca76b06d8c9b6ec01", "ja": "では……私が専門外である恋愛相談に\n慌てふためく様子を、面白がるために……？", "zh": "那么……只是为了看我面对并不擅长的恋爱咨询时慌慌张张的样子取乐吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "37b5bb0f442011aca2d43869758388624d336e528c638b2587373a098448233a", "ja": "そういうわけでもなくって！\nなんていうか……うーん、そうだな……。", "zh": "也不是这个意思！\n该怎么说呢……嗯，是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "6985e313a12b5e6b8651983a4e0f32423937b4dc37510eac09c3664db356056e", "ja": "紬は、今みたいに言葉を、いろんな形で\n受け止めてくれるだろう？　多面的っていうか。", "zh": "紬，你不是会像刚才那样，从各种角度去理解别人说的话吗？可以说是很有多面性吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3cab4ab65a46f39aef8de9f488837198c287605023c15ba50019e3c40bf295e7", "ja": "だから、恋愛の悩みにも、いろんな切り口で\nアドバイスをしてあげられるんじゃないかって。", "zh": "所以，我觉得你应该也能从各个角度，为恋爱烦恼提供建议吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a3f6c86a344337f59dbe22e445877a4de1aec61b1fbb71afbd2110e053ddb89c", "ja": "多面的……。\nなるほど。そういうことでしたら……。", "zh": "多方面……。\n原来如此。既然是这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "4fbd22a738f617163b68fe9ddf2f46ad40ba028a74d70013e48a1f78c8ebfe74", "ja": "{$P$}は、私たちのココロの形を\nしっかり感じてくれているんですね。", "zh": "{$P$}确实切实感受到了\n我们内心的形状呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "5e6ec2b3b23618985a651f51bc3d5188561ad31482c866a5e05c9ca69ebdcda2", "ja": "そうですね。たまに疑問が浮かんだり、\n驚いたりもしますけど。", "zh": "是啊。虽然偶尔也会产生疑问，或是感到惊讶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1cee9943e92e6574729103a0f4e36862c3314dc7aeb4491ce98198432fd3929f", "ja": "アンドロイドたちだけでなく、私たちも\n悩んだり考えたりを続けていきますから。", "zh": "不仅是那些仿生人，我们也会继续烦恼、思考下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fca219894785ff72406caa0730159bcc7098dd023f3afdc5d1bfb9859dea2450", "ja": "だから、立ち止まってしまいそうな時は……\n頼りにさせてください、{$P$}。", "zh": "所以，当我感觉自己快要停下脚步时……\n请让我依靠您，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "9fcd6b3c801b518ff46becf45d8d9fd91396924d29ad558729564f9e2cddf477", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！", "zh": "嗯，当然可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "0ab9bf7dd4045de7538d5731793d366c8c7ffe01824ab1e6e6f1cb7948392e0a", "ja": "（人間もアンドロイドも、思考しながら進んでいく。\n障害も難問も多いだろうけど……）", "zh": "（人类和安卓都在一边思考，一边继续前进。前方一定会有许多障碍和难题……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "746f7cbc0c443e3f6068f36b724c320adfb1479476e975a4bd4a72135187baa8", "ja": "（一緒に手を取って進んでいけば、きっと想像も\nつかない、素晴らしい未来が広がっているはずだ！）", "zh": "（只要一起携手前进，前方一定会有难以想象的美好未来在等待着我们！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
